    {
      "id": "legend",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "**Workflow**\nPLAN → APPROVED → EXECUTED → CANDIDATE → PASS / REWORK / ESCALATE → DELIVERED\n\nWhoever executes does not review. Overrides via `pi.sh override` (T002, T006, T007).\n\n[[Agent Team Overview]] · [[Roles]] · [[Task Workflow]] · [[Scripts and Safeguards]]",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "pi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## PI – Anton\nDecides question, estimand, sample, data rules, claims.\n`agents/pi.sh` approve · accept · return · override\nReceives ESCALATE directly."
    },
    {
      "id": "tasks",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "**tasks/**\n`T###.md` cards (only status source) · `T###_report.md`"
    },
    {
      "id": "review",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 130,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "**review/**\n`T###.md` verdicts · `*_frozen.sha256` · `*_latex.txt`"
    },
    {
      "id": "state",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "**state/**\n`STATE.md` decisions · `runs.log` · `approvals.log` · `terminal.log`"
    },
    {
      "id": "dash",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "**Dashboard**\n`python3 agents/dashboard.py`\n→ http://localhost:8765\nreads only tasks/ review/ state/"
    },
    {
      "id": "copi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## Co-PI – Claude Code\nWrites cards, runs worker, first-pass QA, freezes candidate.\nOnly session that edits project files outside tasks/ review/ state/."
    },
    {
      "id": "wd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "### Worker data/code – Codex\n`codex exec -s workspace-write`\nPython + `Rscript` (R [number withheld])\nwrites only the card's write scope"
    },
    {
      "id": "rv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "### Reviewer\nAntigravity `--mode plan` (data) · Codex `-s read-only` (text)\nVerdict → `review/T###.md` via script; ESCALATE → PI"
    },
    {
      "id": "wt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 960,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "### Worker text – Claude\nseparate call, no chat history\n`Edit(./proposal/**)` only, no Bash"
    },
    {
      "id": "ak",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "**Daten/akshare_output/**\nEastMoney via AKShare: listed A + HK, delisted HK (raw CSV, read only)"
    },
    {
      "id": "wind",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1530,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "**Daten/wind_2[number withheld][number withheld][number withheld]/**\nWind visit [number withheld]: delisted A ([number withheld]) + HK ([number withheld]) statements, ownership (实际控制人属性)"
    },
    {
      "id": "repl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "## replication/ (R / RStudio)\n`code/01_clean.R` → `data/processed/panel_firm_halfyear.csv`\n`outputs/tables`, `outputs/figures`\n[[Replication Package]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "ol",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "## proposal/ ⇄ Overleaf\n`agents/overleaf.sh pull · check · push T###`\npush only at DELIVERED"
    }
